WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
00:33.638 --> 00:34.472
Look at her.

4
00:36.057 --> 00:37.308
How's she not hot in that?

5
00:37.892 --> 00:40.186
I hear she's a germophobe.

6
00:40.687 --> 00:43.189
Her phone case is a fucking brick.

7
00:43.273 --> 00:45.191
She wraps it like that 'cause of germs.

8
00:45.275 --> 00:46.317
Class is starting.

9
00:46.818 --> 00:48.153
Back to your seats.

10
00:49.654 --> 00:51.322
If the class president says so.

11
00:56.828 --> 00:58.496
There was a time

12
00:58.997 --> 01:01.207
when I had hope.

13
01:01.291 --> 01:03.543
Hey, did you just hear that?

14
01:03.626 --> 01:05.503
The class president's looking out for you.

15
01:06.796 --> 01:08.673
How was that looking out for me?

16
01:14.971 --> 01:16.472
So you and I can eat together.

17
01:17.724 --> 01:20.768
Good Eats has the new jjajang tteokbokki. I wanna try it.

18
01:21.436 --> 01:22.896
Maybe not Good Eats…

19
01:24.606 --> 01:25.440
What was that?

20
01:26.858 --> 01:27.692
What?

21
01:28.193 --> 01:31.654
Your face lit up when you saw the class president just now.

22
01:31.738 --> 01:33.156
No, it didn't.

23
01:33.239 --> 01:34.490
Yeah, it did.

24
01:37.952 --> 01:39.454
All right. Focus.

25
01:39.537 --> 01:41.581
The hope that maybe someone out there

26
01:42.540 --> 01:45.168
could accept a monster like me.

27
01:45.251 --> 01:48.254
We'll look at the average rate of change from a to b.

28
01:48.338 --> 01:53.843
Now, delta y over delta x equals f(b) minus f(a) over b minus a…

29
01:55.637 --> 01:57.931
It's Pepero Day.

30
01:59.015 --> 02:00.391
I got you something too.

31
02:01.059 --> 02:02.060
Thank you.

32
02:02.143 --> 02:03.311
I'll enjoy it.

33
02:09.317 --> 02:10.485
I'm sorry!

34
02:11.152 --> 02:12.320
-I-- -What did you do?

35
02:13.446 --> 02:14.781
Did you get hurt?

36
02:14.864 --> 02:16.157
Let me see.

37
02:16.241 --> 02:17.367
Hey, it's bad.

38
02:17.867 --> 02:19.869
-Was that on purpose? -You need a doctor.

39
02:20.787 --> 02:22.956
-What did she do? -You should see a doctor.

40
02:23.873 --> 02:25.458
Are you sure you're okay?

41
02:25.541 --> 02:27.335
-I'm sorry. Are you-- -Don't touch me.

42
02:28.461 --> 02:29.796
Don't come near me.

43
02:38.304 --> 02:40.098
But reality

44
02:41.724 --> 02:45.353
kept crushing every hope I had.

45
02:51.442 --> 02:54.279
Always telling me I was different from everyone else.

46
02:54.362 --> 02:55.280
No.

47
02:56.155 --> 02:57.448
That I was wrong.

48
03:52.337 --> 03:54.714
Sir, you should get that treated first.

49
03:55.757 --> 03:56.591
It's fine.

50
03:56.674 --> 04:00.386
Check the next flight and see if the airport's back to normal.

51
04:00.970 --> 04:01.929
Sir.

52
04:37.715 --> 04:39.008
I'm sorry.

53
04:39.092 --> 04:41.636
You missed your flight because of me.

54
04:42.220 --> 04:43.930
You were trying to protect me…

55
04:46.891 --> 04:48.351
What's that? Are you hurt?

56
04:49.352 --> 04:50.228
No, it's fine.

57
04:51.062 --> 04:54.065
-Let me see. You're bleeding. Right here-- -I said it's fine.

58
04:55.858 --> 04:59.278
Now even Mr. Baek Ho-rang knows.

59
05:00.780 --> 05:02.490
That I'm a monster.

60
05:05.451 --> 05:07.662
You got hurt because of me.

61
05:08.788 --> 05:09.789
I'm sorry.

62
05:13.668 --> 05:15.086
Don't worry about it.

63
05:35.940 --> 05:38.818
Why did I dare to hope again?

64
05:40.319 --> 05:42.071
Nothing about me has changed.

65
05:44.490 --> 05:45.867
Why did I let myself…

66
05:47.952 --> 05:50.663
hope for an ordinary life again?

67
06:11.934 --> 06:13.561
Oh, wait.

68
06:34.165 --> 06:36.667
What happened here?

69
06:37.502 --> 06:40.254
I had it done before the trip.

70
06:40.838 --> 06:44.133
I promised I'd renovate it for you.

71
06:44.634 --> 06:46.802
This place was empty, so…

72
06:49.305 --> 06:50.348
Just

73
06:51.349 --> 06:53.059
use it as a studio.

74
06:54.977 --> 06:56.354
What about the bed?

75
06:56.437 --> 06:57.271
What?

76
06:57.355 --> 07:00.274
Why did you take the bed out?

77
07:01.192 --> 07:02.068
Well,

78
07:02.568 --> 07:05.238
they say it's better

79
07:05.321 --> 07:08.282
to keep your workspace and bedroom separate.

80
07:08.366 --> 07:13.246
And there are plenty of spare rooms here.

81
07:13.329 --> 07:16.874
I think it'd be best to use this room just as a workspace.

82
07:16.958 --> 07:19.001
I'll just stay here.

83
07:19.085 --> 07:21.504
I can sleep on the couch.

84
07:22.296 --> 07:23.422
Why?

85
07:24.507 --> 07:26.133
You don't want to come inside?

86
07:28.052 --> 07:30.471
This is a contractual relationship.

87
07:30.972 --> 07:34.976
We just have to stay within ten meters. We don't need to be any closer.

88
07:35.726 --> 07:37.228
That's what you said.

89
07:45.611 --> 07:46.904
Well,

90
07:47.572 --> 07:49.615
if it's because of this injury--

91
07:49.699 --> 07:51.867
No, it's not that. It's just…

92
07:54.370 --> 07:58.207
I've been thinking about what you said in Jeju,

93
07:58.291 --> 08:00.251
and it made me a little uncomfortable.

94
08:03.462 --> 08:06.591
Could you leave now? I'm a little tired.

95
09:02.688 --> 09:04.482
What are you even talking about?

96
09:04.565 --> 09:05.858
Good morning.

97
09:09.445 --> 09:10.613
Hello.

98
09:22.750 --> 09:24.210
Did everyone get some rest?

99
09:26.212 --> 09:27.713
-Ms. Yang. -Yes?

100
09:27.797 --> 09:29.674
Can you check Mr. Baek's schedule for me?

101
09:29.757 --> 09:30.591
Sure.

102
09:36.347 --> 09:37.765
Did you leak Na Bo-bae's info?

103
09:56.242 --> 09:57.493
RÉSUMÉ

104
09:58.369 --> 10:00.329
LOOKS LIKE SHE LIVES SOMEWHERE ELSE

105
10:00.413 --> 10:01.664
Interesting.

106
10:03.207 --> 10:05.751
Just let it slip that she works at TS Resort.

107
10:05.835 --> 10:08.754
Those who can't resist digging into other people's lives

108
10:09.255 --> 10:11.132
will find the rest.

109
10:11.632 --> 10:15.010
You guys know where this is? TS Resort, the best resort in the country.

110
10:15.094 --> 10:16.721
I'm here to meet Ji Eun-ho's fiancée.

111
10:16.804 --> 10:18.848
Look! It's the resort staff!

112
10:20.015 --> 10:21.851
They refuse to acknowledge us.

113
10:21.934 --> 10:24.395
The fans are up in arms, and it's total chaos!

114
10:24.478 --> 10:27.523
They're losing it, calling it favoritism. You see this?

115
10:27.606 --> 10:28.774
Man, this is…

116
10:30.776 --> 10:31.610
Yes?

117
10:37.366 --> 10:41.203
I'll head home on my own starting today.

118
10:44.290 --> 10:45.916
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

119
10:46.000 --> 10:46.959
Wait!

120
10:51.964 --> 10:53.966
What are you doing? Someone might see us.

121
10:54.759 --> 10:58.012
-We said we'd only meet to charge you. -Let's go home together.

122
10:58.804 --> 11:00.306
It's not safe to be alone now.

123
11:05.102 --> 11:06.353
Did you forget?

124
11:06.854 --> 11:08.898
I'm the most dangerous person.

125
11:09.690 --> 11:14.403
And I'm uncomfortable being around you all the time now.

126
11:24.622 --> 11:29.585
All right, everyone. Let's see what TS Resort has to say.

127
11:29.668 --> 11:30.753
There's a car coming!

128
11:30.836 --> 11:33.964
Is that Ms. Na? Hey! Over here!

129
11:34.048 --> 11:35.007
She's in there!

130
11:35.090 --> 11:37.802
Hey, these TS guys are hitting me!

131
11:37.885 --> 11:39.470
They're hitting me!

132
11:39.553 --> 11:42.223
That hurts!

133
11:52.942 --> 11:53.776
Are you okay?

134
11:58.072 --> 12:00.950
Are they reporters? They don't look like Ji Eun-ho's fans.

135
12:01.033 --> 12:02.618
They're clickbait YouTubers.

136
12:03.118 --> 12:05.955
They somehow found out that Ms. Na works at the resort.

137
12:06.705 --> 12:07.915
They keep showing up.

138
12:07.998 --> 12:09.041
YouTubers?

139
12:09.708 --> 12:12.670
Are you saying they're all here to catch Ms. Na on camera?

140
12:14.255 --> 12:16.549
She said she'd go home alone today.

141
12:16.632 --> 12:18.300
I saw her leave through the back door.

142
12:18.884 --> 12:20.678
Don't worry, I assigned her a bodyguard.

143
12:20.761 --> 12:22.263
Oh, really?

144
12:23.305 --> 12:25.266
For now,

145
12:26.392 --> 12:28.269
tighten security at the resort.

146
12:28.769 --> 12:32.648
Report them all for obstruction of business.

147
12:33.399 --> 12:35.526
Don't let them lay a finger on Ms. Na.

148
12:36.819 --> 12:37.653
Yes, sir.

149
12:49.415 --> 12:51.208
15 NEW MESSAGES FROM SEO-JEONG

150
12:51.292 --> 12:52.960
9 NEW MESSAGES FROM PRECIOUS

151
12:56.881 --> 12:59.300
Bo-bae, why aren't you picking up?

152
12:59.383 --> 13:01.677
We're always on your side, okay?

153
13:01.760 --> 13:03.596
Na Bo-bae, aren't you going to reply?

154
13:03.679 --> 13:04.638
Are you okay?

155
13:04.722 --> 13:06.432
Call me as soon as you see this.

156
13:06.515 --> 13:09.101
What am I supposed to tell Ji-hye and Yong-gi?

157
13:14.523 --> 13:15.649
JU-HEE

158
13:15.733 --> 13:17.818
Bo-bae, are you okay?

159
13:19.945 --> 13:22.239
This is about you, right? This is awful.

160
13:22.323 --> 13:25.701
I know you're laughing while sending crying emojis.

161
13:31.498 --> 13:33.375
THE WOMAN JI EUN-HO PROPOSED TO IS A DRAMA WRITER

162
13:35.085 --> 13:36.503
She's only written a one-act.

163
13:36.587 --> 13:38.714
-Na Bo-who? -A writer? Yeah, right.

164
13:38.797 --> 13:41.383
-Anybody's a writer now. -She wrote Eun-ho's debut?

165
13:41.467 --> 13:42.301
She got him then.

166
13:42.384 --> 13:44.762
-Wistful Youth? -Focus on your writing.

167
13:44.845 --> 13:46.555
Failed as a writer, chased an actor.

168
13:46.639 --> 13:49.433
She's not even that pretty. What's with her hair?

169
13:49.516 --> 13:50.768
-Her hair's a mess. -Crazy.

170
13:50.851 --> 13:51.685
Unbelievable.

171
13:51.769 --> 13:53.228
She doesn't know her place.

172
13:53.312 --> 13:54.772
Like they know anything.

173
13:54.855 --> 13:57.483
Maybe I should just sue them all.

174
14:00.319 --> 14:02.780
It's not true. Why can't I say so?

175
14:02.863 --> 14:04.114
Bo-bae…

176
14:04.615 --> 14:06.200
What about Ms. Na's reputation?

177
14:06.283 --> 14:08.494
This is on me. I should explain.

178
14:08.577 --> 14:10.537
Type "Ji Eun-ho" into the search bar,

179
14:10.621 --> 14:12.373
and "Na Bo-bae" comes up beside it.

180
14:13.123 --> 14:15.709
You look like some idiot who's lost his head over a woman.

181
14:15.793 --> 14:17.461
She's getting it worse than I am.

182
14:17.544 --> 14:19.922
Right now, all over social media and the news--

183
14:20.005 --> 14:21.382
Exactly!

184
14:22.257 --> 14:23.968
You're a celebrity, Eun-ho.

185
14:24.051 --> 14:26.887
The moment you try to explain this rumor,

186
14:26.971 --> 14:29.848
you add fuel to a fire that could've died down on its own.

187
14:29.932 --> 14:32.142
Then what's going to happen to her?

188
14:34.353 --> 14:36.689
The best thing you can do is say nothing.

189
14:36.772 --> 14:39.733
The fastest way for this to blow over is to keep your mouth shut.

190
14:53.956 --> 14:57.084
Find out who started the rumor about Ms. Na and Ji Eun-ho.

191
14:57.167 --> 14:58.252
Sorry?

192
14:58.335 --> 15:00.421
We need to put this rumor to rest.

193
15:01.005 --> 15:04.008
One's the face of TS Resort, and the other…

194
15:07.594 --> 15:08.554
is my secretary.

195
15:09.138 --> 15:11.890
Sir, is this really the time for that?

196
15:11.974 --> 15:13.809
The TS Hotel embezzlement case…

197
15:16.520 --> 15:17.730
It's time to expose it.

198
15:17.813 --> 15:19.732
The situation has changed.

199
15:19.815 --> 15:22.234
When the situation changes, so does the plan.

200
15:30.659 --> 15:32.327
Hello.

201
15:33.203 --> 15:34.747
-Hello. -Good to see you.

202
15:34.830 --> 15:36.373
Thank you for coming all this way.

203
15:36.457 --> 15:37.291
-Pleasure. -Yes.

204
15:50.345 --> 15:51.764
Mr. Yoon.

205
15:51.847 --> 15:54.641
We've done well for the past 15 years.

206
15:55.142 --> 15:56.018
Right?

207
15:57.895 --> 15:59.688
Yes. We have.

208
16:01.648 --> 16:03.317
You may feel a little uneasy

209
16:03.400 --> 16:06.862
since it looks like you're taking the fall alone,

210
16:06.945 --> 16:10.991
but you've benefited from it all these years too.

211
16:13.577 --> 16:15.454
Just do a little time…

212
16:17.623 --> 16:21.043
and I'll make sure your daughter is set for life.

213
16:30.469 --> 16:32.096
Yes.

214
16:32.596 --> 16:33.514
Yes, sir.

215
16:35.432 --> 16:36.767
Oh man.

216
16:37.726 --> 16:41.105
I can't wait to see the look on Ho-rang's face.

217
16:45.734 --> 16:48.821
I wonder how he'll react when the article comes out.

218
16:51.240 --> 16:55.077
Why did you ask us to come here?

219
16:55.160 --> 16:56.495
I'd like to know too.

220
16:56.578 --> 16:58.205
Why would you need

221
16:58.288 --> 17:00.791
a failing newspaper publisher and a TV broadcaster?

222
17:00.874 --> 17:04.878
Come on. Don't be so modest.

223
17:04.962 --> 17:09.466
You two have the country's press and media in the palm of your hand.

224
17:11.051 --> 17:15.764
Actually, our son is getting ready to take over TS Group.

225
17:15.848 --> 17:17.641
Director Choi Do-yoon?

226
17:17.724 --> 17:18.559
Yes.

227
17:18.642 --> 17:21.812
If you two help us out this time,

228
17:21.895 --> 17:25.065
I'll return the favor when you're in a bind.

229
17:41.957 --> 17:42.916
Sir.

230
17:52.009 --> 17:52.885
Sir.

231
17:53.385 --> 17:54.303
We have a problem.

232
18:26.501 --> 18:28.253
-He's coming out! -There he is!

233
18:28.754 --> 18:32.090
-A few words about Mr. Baek Ho-rang? -Any comment on Mr. Baek?

234
18:35.010 --> 18:37.054
Do you have anything to say about Mr. Baek?

235
18:37.137 --> 18:40.140
As a member of the family,

236
18:40.641 --> 18:44.436
I take full responsibility for all the controversies surrounding him.

237
18:45.062 --> 18:48.482
I'd like to apologize to the public on his behalf.

238
18:49.816 --> 18:52.736
DOSEONG DAILY "TS HOTEL EXECUTIVE COMES CLEAN"

239
18:59.534 --> 19:01.954
BAEK HO-RANG BETRAYS FAMILY, EMBEZZLES 8 BILLION WON

240
19:02.037 --> 19:05.040
I almost fainted when I read the article.

241
19:05.123 --> 19:06.500
My nephew…

242
19:07.626 --> 19:09.253
My own nephew!

243
19:09.795 --> 19:15.425
Embezzling money from TS Hotel just to screw Do-yoon and me over?

244
19:15.509 --> 19:18.720
I can't believe it. It's terrible!

245
19:19.554 --> 19:21.932
The media is in a frenzy.

246
19:22.015 --> 19:24.309
It's all over social media and YouTube.

247
19:24.393 --> 19:25.727
There's even a petition.

248
19:25.811 --> 19:28.355
This doesn't look like it'll blow over anytime soon.

249
19:28.438 --> 19:29.564
And the stock's tanked.

250
19:29.648 --> 19:30.941
Is this true, Mr. Baek?

251
19:31.024 --> 19:33.527
Say something, will you?

252
19:34.945 --> 19:36.321
Senior Managing Director Baek.

253
19:36.822 --> 19:38.448
Are you out of your mind?

254
19:38.532 --> 19:41.535
It's true I had a meal with Vice President Yoon Dong-seok.

255
19:42.494 --> 19:45.163
And it's true we talked about the embezzlement case.

256
19:45.247 --> 19:46.873
Look at him.

257
19:46.957 --> 19:50.877
That's why you can't trust anyone, not even your own flesh and blood.

258
19:51.378 --> 19:52.754
That bastard.

259
19:53.255 --> 19:55.549
He thought he could walk all over TS Group--

260
19:55.632 --> 19:56.633
Quiet.

261
20:01.054 --> 20:01.972
And?

262
20:02.055 --> 20:06.977
He met me as a whistleblower in the TS Hotel embezzlement case.

263
20:07.728 --> 20:08.729
He had evidence.

264
20:08.812 --> 20:10.397
Senior Managing Director Baek!

265
20:10.480 --> 20:11.356
Sit down.

266
20:14.443 --> 20:17.654
Listen, Yoon Dong-seok already confessed to everything.

267
20:18.238 --> 20:20.866
I heard he gave you the ledgers on a regular basis.

268
20:20.949 --> 20:23.327
Where did you hide them? Where are the ledgers?

269
20:23.410 --> 20:25.537
I can submit the evidence right now.

270
20:26.204 --> 20:28.832
-Even to the media. -Some evidence would be nice.

271
20:28.915 --> 20:30.876
If you're innocent, prove it.

272
20:31.501 --> 20:34.421
Chairwoman, let's trust Ho-rang and wait.

273
20:34.504 --> 20:36.465
He says he's got evidence and all.

274
20:36.548 --> 20:39.092
I was just starting to think you had potential.

275
20:40.010 --> 20:42.846
If you don't fix this,

276
20:44.181 --> 20:45.724
I'll drop you without a second thought.

277
20:45.807 --> 20:47.225
You know that, right?

278
20:49.061 --> 20:51.521
Anyone can be replaced.

279
20:57.235 --> 20:59.363
Maybe you should talk to Seol-hee.

280
21:11.708 --> 21:13.210
I'll head down first.

281
21:23.929 --> 21:27.391
I guess you got in touch with my grandmother.

282
21:27.891 --> 21:28.725
Yes.

283
21:29.893 --> 21:31.937
I actually know Yoon Dong-seok.

284
21:32.020 --> 21:33.772
I met him a few times with Do-yoon.

285
21:34.689 --> 21:37.609
I know what they often talked about.

286
21:37.692 --> 21:40.112
I also know Yoon Dong-seok's weaknesses.

287
21:40.737 --> 21:41.947
And

288
21:42.030 --> 21:45.283
I know that Yoon Dong-seok is framing you.

289
21:48.954 --> 21:50.914
You'll be my witness?

290
21:53.083 --> 21:54.501
Not just a witness.

291
21:55.001 --> 21:57.921
I can use Hanlim's influence to help you.

292
21:58.922 --> 22:01.425
I'm saying I have the card to turn this around.

293
22:02.426 --> 22:04.803
And I have the means to get the message out.

294
22:08.765 --> 22:11.393
I assume you're not offering to do it for free.

295
22:12.769 --> 22:14.020
There has to be a catch.

296
22:15.313 --> 22:16.481
Of course.

297
22:16.982 --> 22:18.817
You know I want something from you.

298
22:23.488 --> 22:25.031
I'll save

299
22:26.158 --> 22:28.869
both TS and you.

300
22:30.829 --> 22:32.873
Wouldn't marrying me be

301
22:33.373 --> 22:34.666
a pretty good deal?

302
22:37.544 --> 22:40.005
Baek Ho-rang, senior managing director of TS Resort,

303
22:40.088 --> 22:43.049
is under suspicion of embezzling funds from TS Hotel.

304
22:43.133 --> 22:48.054
Backlash against Mr. Baek is growing as new mistreatment allegations emerge.

305
22:48.138 --> 22:50.056
A close confidant claims

306
22:50.140 --> 22:53.185
Mr. Baek has long suffered from a serious mental illness.

307
22:53.268 --> 22:56.062
The crisis has ignited debate over the company's leadership.

308
22:56.146 --> 22:59.900
-What is this? -Similar concerns over its successor…

309
23:19.836 --> 23:22.756
Guys, I'm on my way to meet that notorious writer.

310
23:22.839 --> 23:27.302
Check out this fancy neighborhood. How much do you have to make to live here?

311
23:27.385 --> 23:28.220
Look at these houses.

312
23:28.303 --> 23:30.096
Here we are, guys.

313
23:30.180 --> 23:32.682
All right, I'm ringing the bell.

314
23:33.183 --> 23:35.352
RUBBER GLOVE

315
23:46.655 --> 23:47.531
Who is it?

316
23:48.240 --> 23:50.408
Ms. Na Bo-bae? Delivery.

317
23:50.492 --> 23:52.285
I need your signature.

318
23:54.162 --> 23:55.288
A delivery?

319
23:55.997 --> 23:59.960
Guys, this is it. We're about to meet that troublemaker.

320
24:00.043 --> 24:03.505
I think she's coming out. Told you I'd get to the bottom of this.

321
24:03.588 --> 24:05.465
-Excuse me. -Yes?

322
24:05.966 --> 24:07.759
I live right across the street.

323
24:08.343 --> 24:10.220
You said delivery. Where's the package?

324
24:10.303 --> 24:12.556
Mind your own business. Just move along.

325
24:13.139 --> 24:15.350
-I told you, I live across the street. -So?

326
24:15.433 --> 24:18.228
Heard there's a burglar around here. Was it you?

327
24:18.311 --> 24:21.398
A burglar? I'm a reporter! See this camera?

328
24:21.982 --> 24:24.192
A reporter? Which outlet?

329
24:24.276 --> 24:26.278
What's it to you?

330
24:27.946 --> 24:29.864
Why are you covering your face?

331
24:29.948 --> 24:31.408
You live in a fancy area.

332
24:31.491 --> 24:33.159
Are you famous or--

333
24:33.952 --> 24:36.663
You tried to hit me with that camera. You're the burglar.

334
24:37.831 --> 24:39.833
You bastard! I'm gonna call the cops!

335
24:39.916 --> 24:41.459
Call the cops? Think you can?

336
24:41.543 --> 24:44.671
A fake courier calling the cops after filming and assaulting someone?

337
24:44.754 --> 24:46.298
-Be my guest. -That hurts!

338
24:46.381 --> 24:47.257
Damn it.

339
24:51.219 --> 24:53.597
Let me go! You're breaking my arm!

340
24:53.680 --> 24:56.600
You're gonna break it! Damn it!

341
24:56.683 --> 24:59.227
Let go, you bastard! This is expensive!

342
25:00.770 --> 25:01.646
Eun-ho.

343
25:09.571 --> 25:12.324
How did you know I was here?

344
25:18.038 --> 25:19.372
I was waiting next door.

345
25:20.081 --> 25:21.708
I heard what that guy said.

346
25:21.791 --> 25:23.126
Oh.

347
25:29.007 --> 25:30.467
I'm sorry I lied to you.

348
25:30.550 --> 25:33.970
No, I'm sorry for putting you through this.

349
25:38.183 --> 25:39.976
Even after I got rejected.

350
25:43.480 --> 25:44.606
I like you, Bo-bae.

351
25:52.822 --> 25:54.324
The last three years…

352
25:55.950 --> 25:57.911
I only got through it because of you.

353
26:00.705 --> 26:04.459
There wasn't a single day you didn't help me, Eun-ho.

354
26:06.336 --> 26:08.546
You always said you were my fan

355
26:09.631 --> 26:12.008
and wanted to keep reading my scripts.

356
26:14.719 --> 26:16.304
That's how I got this far.

357
26:19.891 --> 26:21.559
Why do I have a bad feeling?

358
26:24.979 --> 26:25.980
But…

359
26:32.362 --> 26:35.031
I found someone who feels like fate.

360
26:36.658 --> 26:37.617
And…

361
26:39.619 --> 26:41.121
it's not you.

362
26:44.249 --> 26:45.291
I'm sorry.

363
26:59.431 --> 27:01.558
That's just cruel.

364
27:02.809 --> 27:04.269
I'm sorry, Eun-ho.

365
27:17.449 --> 27:19.409
How's Mr. Fate doing?

366
27:19.909 --> 27:21.995
I saw the news. Looks like it's a real mess.

367
27:22.078 --> 27:23.204
Oh.

368
27:26.374 --> 27:28.001
I don't really know.

369
27:28.501 --> 27:30.211
It's got nothing to do with me.

370
27:30.295 --> 27:32.130
Then why do you look like that?

371
27:32.839 --> 27:34.340
Lighten up.

372
27:34.424 --> 27:35.550
Huh?

373
27:36.342 --> 27:37.343
Right.

374
27:41.598 --> 27:43.224
Try not to worry too much.

375
27:45.769 --> 27:47.979
I don't know Mr. Baek that well,

376
27:48.897 --> 27:53.693
but he's not the type to embezzle or mistreat people.

377
27:55.737 --> 27:57.071
You'd know better than I do.

378
28:05.872 --> 28:07.916
I'll get going.

379
28:09.292 --> 28:11.461
Don't open the door to strangers.

380
28:11.961 --> 28:12.796
Okay.

381
28:15.632 --> 28:16.591
Bo-bae.

382
28:18.885 --> 28:21.638
You rejected me, but I'm still your number one fan.

383
28:22.639 --> 28:24.140
I'll keep rooting for you.

384
28:24.224 --> 28:25.975
I'm the male lead in your drama.

385
28:26.059 --> 28:27.811
Seriously…

386
28:30.396 --> 28:31.439
And

387
28:32.982 --> 28:34.984
don't let the rumors about us bother you.

388
28:36.486 --> 28:38.196
Okay. I won't.

389
28:40.031 --> 28:42.617
No dating. Just write. Your number one fan's waiting.

390
28:43.201 --> 28:44.869
Dating? I'm not dating.

391
28:45.578 --> 28:48.122
Go on. Go act.

392
28:48.206 --> 28:49.457
I'm your fan too.

393
28:49.541 --> 28:51.793
Oh, thank you.

394
28:53.294 --> 28:54.838
I'm off. Don't come out.

395
29:11.938 --> 29:13.606
You're surprisingly bold.

396
29:14.107 --> 29:16.317
I didn't expect you to bring me to a suite.

397
29:16.901 --> 29:18.528
This is the most secure place.

398
29:21.322 --> 29:25.535
And I think I'm starting to see what kind of person you are.

399
29:27.495 --> 29:28.746
What kind of person am I?

400
29:30.081 --> 29:31.207
Someone

401
29:32.667 --> 29:33.626
like me.

402
29:39.799 --> 29:41.593
Spot on.

403
29:42.302 --> 29:44.095
I like that answer.

404
29:45.763 --> 29:48.558
So are you attracted to me now?

405
29:49.851 --> 29:51.311
Back in Jeju,

406
29:51.811 --> 29:56.274
you said that having many plans meant I wasn't certain.

407
29:57.108 --> 29:59.402
You're right. I'm uncertain and anxious.

408
30:00.028 --> 30:02.363
Anxious to hide my weaknesses perfectly.

409
30:03.114 --> 30:03.948
Then…

410
30:04.032 --> 30:05.033
Even so,

411
30:05.116 --> 30:08.494
I'll have to decline your offer.

412
30:09.329 --> 30:13.374
I've lived with anxiety and doubt my whole life,

413
30:13.458 --> 30:16.878
so I tend to stay calm in situations like this.

414
30:19.672 --> 30:22.759
You brought me all the way here just to tell me that?

415
30:22.842 --> 30:23.885
Yes.

416
30:23.968 --> 30:26.220
I'm turning you down once and for all.

417
30:27.013 --> 30:28.473
If someone saw this,

418
30:30.183 --> 30:31.601
I figured you'd be embarrassed.

419
30:38.441 --> 30:39.984
You never know.

420
30:40.610 --> 30:43.363
Someone could be secretly recording this

421
30:43.863 --> 30:45.281
and editing it

422
30:46.115 --> 30:47.200
to suit their agenda.

423
31:06.010 --> 31:10.431
I didn't expect Director Han Seol-hee to play dirty.

424
31:11.307 --> 31:13.393
No wonder she's always with Choi Do-yoon.

425
31:13.893 --> 31:16.854
Did she admit to making up the rumors about Mr. Ji Eun-ho?

426
31:16.938 --> 31:19.732
She didn't have to. Her face said it all.

427
31:19.816 --> 31:21.109
Where are the secretaries?

428
31:21.192 --> 31:22.944
They rushed back to the office.

429
31:23.027 --> 31:24.696
Oh, I should call Ms. Na too.

430
31:24.779 --> 31:26.030
No, don't call her.

431
31:27.323 --> 31:29.242
Sorry? But surely…

432
31:32.036 --> 31:33.246
I said don't call her.

433
31:34.622 --> 31:35.456
Yes, sir.

434
31:43.464 --> 31:45.591
Wow, it's Ji Eun-ho!

435
31:50.388 --> 31:51.597
Hello.

436
31:52.098 --> 31:55.351
I'm Kang Du-ri, director of The Voice of the Night.

437
32:06.404 --> 32:08.614
Yes, I'm okay.

438
32:09.699 --> 32:11.409
There isn't any reason not to be.

439
32:11.492 --> 32:15.079
I'm grateful I was given the chance to make such a fun movie.

440
32:15.163 --> 32:18.624
Thank you all for coming today.

441
32:19.292 --> 32:23.671
If I can just say something real quick, unrelated to the movie…

442
32:27.216 --> 32:30.344
The woman in the video that's been going around

443
32:30.428 --> 32:32.055
is indeed a drama writer.

444
32:34.640 --> 32:36.309
What's he doing?

445
32:36.392 --> 32:39.395
But there are stories going around that aren't true.

446
32:39.479 --> 32:41.981
That I proposed to her

447
32:42.065 --> 32:44.192
or that she used me.

448
32:44.776 --> 32:47.445
Those are completely untrue.

449
32:50.865 --> 32:55.328
She's simply someone who works hard at writing her scripts.

450
32:56.079 --> 32:58.164
She's someone I deeply respect.

451
33:04.962 --> 33:07.423
I've never had feelings for her beyond that.

452
33:08.841 --> 33:10.551
Not once.

453
33:12.678 --> 33:15.223
That I proposed to her

454
33:15.306 --> 33:17.433
or that she used me.

455
33:17.934 --> 33:20.728
-You said not to worry. -Those are completely untrue.

456
33:21.646 --> 33:22.772
Liar.

457
33:23.523 --> 33:26.567
She's simply someone who works hard…

458
33:26.651 --> 33:28.569
-What a guy. -…at writing her scripts.

459
33:30.238 --> 33:32.365
She's someone I deeply respect.

460
33:32.448 --> 33:34.408
I've never had feelings for her beyond that.

461
33:35.326 --> 33:36.911
Not once.

462
33:41.249 --> 33:42.458
That's a relief.

463
33:43.251 --> 33:44.877
-I understand. -That's right.

464
33:44.961 --> 33:46.712
The reports going around aren't true.

465
33:46.796 --> 33:48.047
They are completely false.

466
33:48.131 --> 33:50.758
I'll take care of it right away. Yes.

467
33:50.842 --> 33:52.760
Do we have a venue for the press conference?

468
33:52.844 --> 33:53.761
Yes.

469
33:55.138 --> 33:55.972
Here it is.

470
33:56.055 --> 33:58.182
-Thanks. -This is TS Resort.

471
33:58.266 --> 34:00.184
The reports are completely false.

472
34:06.983 --> 34:09.068
12:11 A.M.

473
34:34.468 --> 34:35.303
Don't you…

474
34:37.305 --> 34:38.347
need to charge?

475
34:39.348 --> 34:40.433
Oh.

476
34:40.933 --> 34:42.143
It's late,

477
34:43.561 --> 34:47.899
so I was just charging from here, 1% at a time.

478
34:50.109 --> 34:51.736
You could've asked me.

479
34:52.320 --> 34:53.905
Charging you is part of our contract.

480
35:23.184 --> 35:26.729
It'll finally be over tomorrow.

481
35:28.731 --> 35:29.857
The embezzlement case.

482
35:30.441 --> 35:32.360
We're holding a press conference.

483
35:33.110 --> 35:34.028
Right.

484
35:35.029 --> 35:36.072
That's good.

485
35:36.822 --> 35:41.869
But a press conference means you'll be surrounded by cameras.

486
35:42.828 --> 35:45.164
It's the quickest and easiest way.

487
35:46.791 --> 35:49.919
If I take my meds and stay calm,

488
35:51.545 --> 35:52.755
I think I'll manage.

489
35:52.838 --> 35:55.716
But what if you start panicking again?

490
35:57.426 --> 35:59.637
You can't risk that in front of the cameras.

491
36:01.722 --> 36:02.932
Yeah, I can't.

492
36:04.308 --> 36:05.476
But it's okay.

493
36:07.061 --> 36:08.312
I'm sure I'll be fine.

494
36:11.148 --> 36:14.193
I have to do a good job.

495
36:17.238 --> 36:19.907
That's the only way I can take over TS.

496
36:20.741 --> 36:22.535
But why go that far?

497
36:25.454 --> 36:27.123
Because of my parents.

498
36:28.291 --> 36:32.503
I know what kind of company

499
36:32.586 --> 36:35.673
my parents wanted TS to be.

500
36:36.799 --> 36:40.136
I'm the only one who can do it.

501
36:42.596 --> 36:45.474
It's something I have to see through.

502
36:47.893 --> 36:49.103
To do so,

503
36:49.186 --> 36:51.147
I'll have to overcome…

504
36:54.233 --> 36:55.943
the cameras and the flashes.

505
36:59.196 --> 37:02.825
Why are you so afraid of cameras?

506
37:07.663 --> 37:08.539
I'm not sure.

507
37:10.666 --> 37:12.460
To be more precise…

508
37:14.712 --> 37:16.797
I'm afraid

509
37:18.716 --> 37:19.759
of people's eyes

510
37:21.093 --> 37:22.345
on me.

511
37:23.220 --> 37:24.305
He's here!

512
37:24.388 --> 37:25.306
It's Ho-rang!

513
37:25.389 --> 37:26.849
-It's Ho-rang. -Ho-rang!

514
37:27.850 --> 37:29.310
Ho-rang!

515
37:29.393 --> 37:30.394
Ho-rang!

516
37:31.187 --> 37:32.396
Look this way, Ho-rang!

517
37:32.480 --> 37:34.607
Look here, Ho-rang!

518
37:34.690 --> 37:36.108
Just one interview!

519
37:40.905 --> 37:43.032
Ho-rang! Just one interview!

520
37:43.115 --> 37:44.158
Ho-rang!

521
37:50.414 --> 37:53.209
Ho-rang, don't you feel bad for your parents?

522
38:04.970 --> 38:08.307
I told you last time.

523
38:08.391 --> 38:11.936
When my parents died in an accident because of me…

524
38:12.019 --> 38:14.271
How was it your fault?

525
38:15.606 --> 38:19.026
An accident is just an accident.

526
38:19.110 --> 38:21.404
It happened because they were coming to see me.

527
38:21.487 --> 38:23.489
Of course they were. They're your parents.

528
38:23.572 --> 38:25.741
That's what parents do. It's love.

529
38:26.325 --> 38:29.787
The people who shoved cameras in your face were in the wrong.

530
38:29.870 --> 38:32.498
Why should you feel bad? How is it your fault?

531
38:42.591 --> 38:43.509
Well…

532
38:45.845 --> 38:46.929
I guess you're right.

533
38:56.147 --> 38:57.273
Look at me.

534
38:59.233 --> 39:00.651
I know

535
39:01.444 --> 39:03.362
what kind of person Baek Ho-rang is.

536
39:04.572 --> 39:07.450
On the outside, the perfect senior managing director,

537
39:08.284 --> 39:11.287
always sticking to the plan.

538
39:11.996 --> 39:13.330
But underneath,

539
39:13.914 --> 39:15.499
full of worries,

540
39:16.834 --> 39:18.419
always anxious,

541
39:19.628 --> 39:23.340
always taking care of other people before himself…

542
39:26.677 --> 39:28.429
That's how kind you are.

543
39:34.643 --> 39:36.729
Professor Jang told me this.

544
39:38.272 --> 39:39.607
Sometimes in life,

545
39:39.690 --> 39:42.485
even a strange little straw

546
39:43.194 --> 39:45.154
can save a life.

547
39:45.237 --> 39:47.031
Just one straw.

548
39:47.823 --> 39:50.493
So all you need is one.

549
39:50.576 --> 39:52.244
Just one person.

550
39:53.787 --> 39:56.582
Someone who sees you for who you are.

551
39:58.501 --> 39:59.627
You're right.

552
40:02.087 --> 40:02.922
Just one…

553
40:06.133 --> 40:07.676
Just one person is enough.

554
40:08.177 --> 40:12.264
So don't worry about anyone else.

555
40:13.891 --> 40:16.977
Just imagine all the eyes behind the cameras are mine.

556
40:17.811 --> 40:20.648
Looking at you

557
40:20.731 --> 40:22.816
like this.

558
40:34.495 --> 40:35.496
Well…

559
40:37.706 --> 40:40.668
I meant every word I said,

560
40:40.751 --> 40:44.505
but it was only out of human kindness.

561
40:44.588 --> 40:47.716
You know, out of compassion.

562
40:48.551 --> 40:50.302
And because of our contract.

563
40:51.220 --> 40:52.221
I understand.

564
40:54.306 --> 40:55.182
But still,

565
40:56.183 --> 41:00.354
if you came with me tomorrow…

566
41:05.150 --> 41:07.528
I think I'd do better.

567
41:18.122 --> 41:19.707
We're not exactly in a position

568
41:20.666 --> 41:24.128
to attend an official event together.

569
41:24.712 --> 41:25.796
You'll do fine.

570
41:26.589 --> 41:28.215
Just remember what I told you.

571
41:30.968 --> 41:31.802
Okay.

572
41:35.973 --> 41:37.308
I'll get going now.

573
41:56.577 --> 41:58.746
Stay strong, Na Bo-bae.

574
42:01.040 --> 42:03.208
Don't feel sorry for him.

575
42:06.754 --> 42:10.174
Stop thinking about it.

576
42:21.101 --> 42:22.561
SEO-JEONG

577
42:29.526 --> 42:33.155
Hey, Na Bo-bae.

578
42:33.238 --> 42:34.782
-Did you order already? -Yeah.

579
42:35.282 --> 42:37.034
Let me pour you a drink.

580
42:37.785 --> 42:38.744
Oh dear.

581
42:38.827 --> 42:41.372
Hey, at least Eun-ho's loyal, huh?

582
42:41.455 --> 42:44.458
He dropped it live at the premiere.

583
42:44.541 --> 42:46.293
He went all in defending you.

584
42:46.377 --> 42:47.503
Yeah, he did.

585
42:48.170 --> 42:51.256
Then why the long face? The rumor's all cleared up.

586
42:51.340 --> 42:53.759
What long face? I'm in a good mood. Cheers.

587
42:57.680 --> 42:59.223
You sure about that?

588
42:59.973 --> 43:02.810
Don't tell me it's because of Baek Ho-rang.

589
43:02.893 --> 43:04.937
-Because of his embezzlement? -Hey.

590
43:06.438 --> 43:09.191
You really think he embezzled money? He has no reason to.

591
43:09.274 --> 43:10.526
Look at you.

592
43:11.402 --> 43:13.404
What are you, his lawyer?

593
43:18.701 --> 43:20.577
You like Baek Ho-rang, don't you?

594
43:22.287 --> 43:23.247
What?

595
43:23.330 --> 43:24.331
What…

596
43:25.582 --> 43:28.544
What are you talking about? Why would I…

597
43:28.627 --> 43:30.129
That overreaction says it all.

598
43:30.212 --> 43:32.089
Who are you trying to fool?

599
43:32.172 --> 43:34.133
I had a feeling ever since Jeju.

600
43:34.216 --> 43:36.552
I'm Cho Seo-jeong. Relationship expert.

601
43:36.635 --> 43:37.594
Your story bag.

602
43:37.678 --> 43:39.471
I said I don't like him.

603
43:41.223 --> 43:43.517
We'll be done once the contract's over anyway.

604
43:45.018 --> 43:47.020
He'll just keep getting hurt if he's with me.

605
43:47.104 --> 43:47.938
Look at you.

606
43:48.021 --> 43:50.441
There you go, digging yourself into a hole again.

607
43:51.024 --> 43:53.402
Look, even after the contract's over,

608
43:53.485 --> 43:55.446
you can still see each other.

609
43:55.529 --> 43:56.530
And him getting hurt?

610
43:56.613 --> 43:58.365
Your powers don't even work on him.

611
43:58.449 --> 44:00.367
Maybe not directly,

612
44:01.034 --> 44:03.412
but he got hurt because of me at the airport.

613
44:03.912 --> 44:06.123
He probably already knows about my powers.

614
44:07.040 --> 44:08.208
Did you ask him?

615
44:08.959 --> 44:09.793
About what?

616
44:09.877 --> 44:12.588
You did the same thing to me in high school.

617
44:20.387 --> 44:21.221
Move.

618
44:38.864 --> 44:40.616
Cho Seo-jeong…

619
44:42.993 --> 44:44.953
Don't let those losers get you down.

620
44:47.331 --> 44:48.707
You saw it too.

621
44:50.501 --> 44:51.627
I hurt his hand, and--

622
44:51.710 --> 44:53.837
Oh please, he barely got hurt.

623
44:53.921 --> 44:55.297
He was being dramatic.

624
44:55.881 --> 44:57.716
Why does that even matter?

625
44:57.800 --> 44:59.593
I'm your friend.

626
45:00.636 --> 45:02.137
I'll always be on your side.

627
45:08.644 --> 45:09.853
That's all that matters.

628
45:23.617 --> 45:25.661
What if I hadn't put on rubber gloves that day?

629
45:25.744 --> 45:27.037
You would've been like,

630
45:27.538 --> 45:30.374
"Cho Seo-jeong's just like everyone else."

631
45:32.125 --> 45:34.127
You would've run away from me.

632
45:34.211 --> 45:36.713
No, that's different from this.

633
45:36.797 --> 45:38.799
You keep doing it.

634
45:39.299 --> 45:41.218
I'm seeing a pattern here.

635
45:41.718 --> 45:43.303
That's your problem, damn it!

636
45:44.012 --> 45:45.806
I'm sorry.

637
45:45.889 --> 45:47.057
That's your problem.

638
45:47.140 --> 45:49.560
You're always hung up on that electricity thing.

639
45:49.643 --> 45:50.936
You get scared and run away.

640
45:51.019 --> 45:52.896
Wouldn't you do the same?

641
45:52.980 --> 45:55.274
Do you know how hard it is to live like this?

642
45:55.774 --> 45:56.733
No, I don't.

643
45:56.817 --> 45:58.443
But I do know one thing.

644
45:58.527 --> 46:01.154
You're just a coward putting on a tough front.

645
46:01.238 --> 46:03.657
Like the rumors with Ji Eun-ho.

646
46:03.740 --> 46:05.826
You just let everyone witch-hunt you.

647
46:05.909 --> 46:09.162
If I were you, I'd make a statement or sue them.

648
46:09.246 --> 46:11.915
How can you just sit there and take it?

649
46:15.711 --> 46:18.005
If it weren't for Ji Eun-ho,

650
46:18.088 --> 46:20.549
you'd be finished, Bo-bae.

651
46:21.049 --> 46:22.593
-Stop already. -Stop what?

652
46:23.552 --> 46:25.596
Is there anyone else who tells you this?

653
46:25.679 --> 46:26.722
No, there isn't.

654
46:26.805 --> 46:28.056
I said stop already!

655
46:35.272 --> 46:37.858
Truth hurts, huh? You're mad 'cause I'm right.

656
46:37.941 --> 46:40.527
How old are you? Act your age.

657
46:40.611 --> 46:42.696
Right back at you!

658
46:42.779 --> 46:44.364
Jeez.

659
46:47.784 --> 46:48.619
So?

660
46:49.828 --> 46:52.039
You gonna get all scared and run away again?

661
47:15.437 --> 47:17.689
Sir, are you sure you'll be okay?

662
47:21.485 --> 47:23.862
I thought so. You don't look well.

663
47:36.375 --> 47:37.417
I'm fine.

664
47:48.136 --> 47:49.721
It's Senior Managing Director Baek.

665
48:15.247 --> 48:16.790
Why did you embezzle the money?

666
48:18.750 --> 48:21.169
BAEK HO-RANG EMERGENCY PRESS CONFERENCE

667
48:21.253 --> 48:23.630
-Please move aside. -Please sit down.

668
48:23.714 --> 48:24.548
Take a seat.

669
48:45.694 --> 48:47.612
So don't worry about anyone else.

670
48:48.196 --> 48:51.241
Just imagine all the eyes behind the cameras are mine.

671
48:52.075 --> 48:54.911
Looking at you

672
48:55.495 --> 48:57.039
like this.

673
49:36.745 --> 49:41.458
I'd like to make a statement

674
49:42.667 --> 49:45.712
regarding the recent embezzlement case at TS Hotel.

675
49:51.426 --> 49:57.516
I have never embezzled a single cent from TS Hotel.

676
49:58.391 --> 50:00.602
I'll fully cooperate with the police

677
50:00.685 --> 50:04.106
to ensure the real culprit

678
50:05.899 --> 50:07.150
is brought to justice.

679
50:23.625 --> 50:25.252
Move out of the way.

680
50:25.335 --> 50:26.795
I can't see!

681
50:26.878 --> 50:29.589
I'm Yoon Dong-seok, the one who named Mr. Baek Ho-rang

682
50:30.090 --> 50:31.299
as an accomplice.

683
50:32.134 --> 50:34.344
My real accomplice…

684
50:38.390 --> 50:40.600
is Assemblyman Choi Tae-sik.

685
50:41.560 --> 50:42.686
I'm sorry.

686
50:42.769 --> 50:45.480
What's that crazy bastard saying?

687
50:45.564 --> 50:47.440
That crazy bastard.

688
50:47.524 --> 50:49.484
Where's Choi Do-yoon?

689
50:49.568 --> 50:51.695
He said he took care of it!

690
50:51.778 --> 50:55.782
We paid off Doseong Daily and JBS. What the hell's going on?

691
50:55.866 --> 50:57.200
Call them! Now!

692
50:59.244 --> 51:00.078
Damn it.

693
51:01.329 --> 51:02.164
I'm sorry.

694
51:02.998 --> 51:03.832
Gyeong-jin?

695
51:03.915 --> 51:05.917
Baek Gyeong-jin!

696
51:06.001 --> 51:07.002
Hey, call 911!

697
51:07.085 --> 51:09.880
Wake up, Gyeong-jin. Baek Gyeong-jin!

698
51:11.464 --> 51:12.424
Are you saying

699
51:12.507 --> 51:17.429
you'll let TS Hotel publish false articles?

700
51:20.348 --> 51:22.225
It might be better that way.

701
51:22.309 --> 51:24.311
Once they let their guard down,

702
51:24.394 --> 51:25.520
we can do

703
51:26.229 --> 51:27.898
what we have to do.

704
51:32.861 --> 51:34.321
What the hell? Who are you?

705
51:34.404 --> 51:36.698
Let go!

706
51:41.578 --> 51:42.704
Baek…

707
51:42.787 --> 51:44.164
Mr. Baek.

708
51:48.293 --> 51:49.586
What is going on?

709
51:54.507 --> 51:55.800
Mr. Yoon.

710
51:56.301 --> 51:58.511
Did you really think I wouldn't know?

711
51:59.429 --> 52:00.472
Sorry?

712
52:00.555 --> 52:04.559
You thought you could frame me with a fake ledger.

713
52:05.310 --> 52:07.103
I'm not that sloppy.

714
52:08.396 --> 52:09.814
Fake? This is real.

715
52:09.898 --> 52:13.693
I already have ten years of slush fund transfer records.

716
52:19.741 --> 52:20.784
Let me guess.

717
52:20.867 --> 52:23.119
My aunt and uncle promised

718
52:23.620 --> 52:26.248
you'd be set for life if you did some time?

719
52:26.331 --> 52:28.416
Or was it Choi Do-yoon?

720
52:29.960 --> 52:30.794
It's just--

721
52:30.877 --> 52:32.295
Do you trust them?

722
52:32.963 --> 52:34.089
Sorry?

723
52:34.172 --> 52:37.342
I know you did it for your wife and daughter.

724
52:43.598 --> 52:44.474
But

725
52:45.600 --> 52:46.935
is this really

726
52:48.019 --> 52:49.896
what's best for your family?

727
52:49.980 --> 52:51.690
Then what should I do?

728
52:52.190 --> 52:54.150
I did embezzle the money with them.

729
52:54.734 --> 52:56.027
There's no way out.

730
52:56.111 --> 52:57.112
Just

731
52:57.612 --> 52:59.614
do what you have to do.

732
52:59.698 --> 53:03.243
Pay for your crimes and tell the truth.

733
53:04.869 --> 53:08.206
Just report Choi Tae-sik first.

734
53:10.583 --> 53:12.294
I'll take care of the rest.

735
53:14.129 --> 53:19.384
Mr. Yoon Dong-seok will cooperate with the police in good faith.

736
53:20.510 --> 53:25.515
I already have evidence of the real embezzlement.

737
53:26.182 --> 53:30.895
I turned it all over to the police yesterday.

738
53:33.565 --> 53:38.445
Actor Ji Eun-ho, who was the victim of malicious rumors,

739
53:40.030 --> 53:42.866
will continue to be

740
53:43.575 --> 53:46.202
the face of TS Resort.

741
53:47.370 --> 53:48.330
Lastly…

742
53:51.124 --> 53:53.835
to Director Han Seol-hee of Hanlim Advertising Company,

743
53:53.918 --> 53:58.506
whose name has been linked to mine since I was named an accomplice,

744
53:59.591 --> 54:02.552
I'd like to officially apologize.

745
54:03.511 --> 54:07.223
For dragging her into false reports that we were getting married…

746
54:09.642 --> 54:12.562
I sincerely apologize.

747
54:16.900 --> 54:19.319
What is your relationship with Ms. Han?

748
54:45.929 --> 54:47.347
Ms. Na Bo-bae!

749
55:06.866 --> 55:08.201
You scared me.

750
55:08.701 --> 55:09.619
Oh, I'm sorry.

751
55:12.080 --> 55:13.957
How did you…

752
55:14.749 --> 55:16.334
How did you get here so fast?

753
55:18.545 --> 55:20.463
There's a shortcut.

754
55:38.148 --> 55:39.190
But

755
55:39.774 --> 55:41.276
why did you run away?

756
55:42.360 --> 55:43.403
I just…

757
55:45.071 --> 55:49.617
When did I run away? I was just… running.

758
55:49.701 --> 55:51.327
You ran away when you saw me.

759
55:51.411 --> 55:52.912
Me? When?

760
55:52.996 --> 55:55.123
You've been running away…

761
55:57.584 --> 55:58.793
ever since Jeju.

762
56:07.385 --> 56:08.261
Ms. Na.

763
56:10.346 --> 56:11.598
Do you really think…

764
56:14.225 --> 56:16.769
I don't know anything about you?

765
56:18.855 --> 56:19.689
What?

766
56:20.190 --> 56:22.817
Ever since you moved into my house,

767
56:23.318 --> 56:26.404
we've had blackouts and broken appliances.

768
56:27.906 --> 56:30.408
And you'd put on rubber gloves for no reason.

769
56:30.950 --> 56:33.786
You even called me a human rubber glove.

770
56:43.004 --> 56:44.088
All this time…

771
56:47.800 --> 56:49.385
you knew?

772
56:50.929 --> 56:53.139
I thought it was strange.

773
56:54.641 --> 56:55.558
But

774
56:56.559 --> 56:58.603
you didn't seem to want to talk about it,

775
56:59.604 --> 57:00.605
so I didn't ask.

776
57:05.109 --> 57:06.069
And

777
57:07.946 --> 57:09.322
after Jeju…

778
57:14.786 --> 57:15.787
none of that

779
57:17.163 --> 57:17.997
mattered

780
57:19.207 --> 57:20.208
anymore.

781
57:22.126 --> 57:23.294
Because I like you.

782
57:26.881 --> 57:27.966
I like you,

783
57:29.759 --> 57:30.885
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

784
57:35.223 --> 57:37.559
The electricity, the contract, whatever.

785
57:37.642 --> 57:38.726
None of it matters.

786
57:41.104 --> 57:42.313
I just…

787
57:44.857 --> 57:46.192
like you.

788
57:57.662 --> 57:58.830
Na Bo-bae is…

789
58:02.125 --> 58:03.710
just Na Bo-bae.

790
58:06.462 --> 58:07.630
So

791
58:09.382 --> 58:11.342
even if I get hurt because of you,

792
58:11.968 --> 58:13.469
I don't care.

793
01:01:20.782 --> 01:01:25.411
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
